            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Build 8 makes exports and imports more reliable and polishes the app.

- Exports can now be cancelled, and quitting mid-job stops them cleanly.
- Exports never overwrite earlier files; repeated exports get numbered names.
- Undo works from the first edit and covers more actions.
- Light mode is readable in the editor preview and timeline.
- New branded installer, tabbed Settings, Open Recent, and many accessibility and layout fixes (including the Exports screen).

Installed builds update to this one automatically (Settings → About → Automatically check for updates).
]]></description>
